OL,3,GNEWSABurns charity founder nominated
OL,4,Afor national award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who survived a bomb attack in
OL,7,FBali has been shortlisted for a
OL,8,Fnational award for her work supporting
OL,9,Fburn survivors.
OL,11,FPolly Brooks, from Guildford, was
OL,12,Fherself severely burnt in the attack in
OL,13,F2002 which killed 202 people in two
OL,14,Fnightclubs.
OL,16,FShe set up Dan's Fund for Burns in
OL,17,Fhonour of her husband of five weeks who
OL,18,Fdied in the bombing.
OL,20,FNow, Brooks says it has "warmed my
OL,21,Fheart" to be one of five finalists in
OL,22,FTiptree's Britain's Morning Heroes.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
